1
00:00:05,825 --> 00:00:07,485
Last time, we dared you.

2
00:00:07,775 --> 00:00:08,665
An ant.

3
00:00:08,935 --> 00:00:09,995
And a spider.

4
00:00:10,275 --> 00:00:11,875
Only one is an insect!

5
00:00:11,973 --> 00:00:12,503
Easy!

6
00:00:12,823 --> 00:00:13,573
Both!

7
00:00:13,633 --> 00:00:15,204
They are small, and they crawl.

8
00:00:15,251 --> 00:00:16,960
Small is not the clue, Basil.

9
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,730
Count the legs!

10
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:20,753
Did you lock in your answer?

11
00:00:21,053 --> 00:00:22,283
Hold on to it.

12
00:00:22,947 --> 00:00:23,547
Ooh!

13
00:00:23,767 --> 00:00:25,817
Can I count Basil's legs too?

14
00:00:25,901 --> 00:00:27,161
Good idea, Momo!

15
00:00:27,351 --> 00:00:28,981
Here is today's big dare.

16
00:00:29,171 --> 00:00:31,101
Insect, reptile, or mammal.

17
00:00:31,271 --> 00:00:32,901
Which group is Basil in?

18
00:00:32,992 --> 00:00:34,133
The cool group!

19
00:00:34,263 --> 00:00:36,153
That is not a group, Basil.

20
00:00:36,205 --> 00:00:37,215
It will be!
